<section class="aub aub-band">
  <div class="aub-wrap">
    <div class="aub-head">
      <h2 class="aub-h2">Inside the bottles</h2>
      <p class="aub-lede">Every ingredient, in the order it appears on the label. Check them. We would.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="aub-inside">
      <article class="aub-bottle">
        <figure class="aub-bottle__photo">
          <img src="{{ 'aubury-serum.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1400" height="1750" loading="lazy" alt="Scalp Exfoliating Serum with its box">
        </figure>
        <div class="aub-bottle__body">
          <p class="aub-kicker">Step 1 · Clarify</p>
          <h3 class="aub-h3">Scalp Exfoliating Serum</h3>
          <dl class="aub-facts">
            <div><dt>Lactic acid</dt><dd>Gently exfoliates and removes buildup.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Sodium hyaluronate</dt><dd>Lightweight moisture for the scalp.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Organic nettle leaf extract</dt><dd>A classic plant in scalp care.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Good to know</dt><dd>Fragrance-free. COSMOS Natural certified, 100% natural origin. Vegan, nut-free. 30 ml.</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <details class="aub-inci">
            <summary>Full ingredient list (INCI)</summary>
            <p class="aub-inci__text">Aqua/Water, Lactic Acid, Pentylene Glycol, Potassium Hydroxide, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin**, Sodium Hyaluronate, Urtica Dioica (Nettle) Leaf Extract*.<br>* from organic farming. ** made using organic ingredients.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="aub-bottle">
        <figure class="aub-bottle__photo">
          <img src="{{ 'aubury-oil.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1000x' }}" width="1400" height="1750" loading="lazy" alt="Scalp Oil with its box">
        </figure>
        <div class="aub-bottle__body">
          <p class="aub-kicker">Step 2 · Nourish</p>
          <h3 class="aub-h3">Scalp Oil with Rosemary &amp; Peppermint</h3>
          <dl class="aub-facts">
            <div><dt>7 organic oils</dt><dd>Sunflower, castor, sweet almond, argan, hemp, olive and avocado.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Rosemary and peppermint</dt><dd>Leaf oils, together with nettle extract. This is a blended care oil, not a pure rosemary oil: rosemary is 11th on the list.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Scent</dt><dd>Peppermint and rosemary on a sweet vanilla-sandalwood base. Contains fragrance.</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Good to know</dt><dd>COSMOS Organic certified, 69% organic, 100% natural origin. Vegan. Contains sweet almond oil (nut). 30 ml.</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <details class="aub-inci">
            <summary>Full ingredient list (INCI)</summary>
            <p class="aub-inci__text">Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil*, Decyl Cocoate, Ricinus Communis (Castor) Seed Oil*, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil*, Argania Spinosa (Argan) Kernel Oil*, Parfum/Fragrance, Cannabis Sativa (Hemp) Seed Oil*, Olea Europaea (Olive) Fruit Oil*, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil*, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil*, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Oil*, Urtica Dioica (Nettle) Leaf Extract*, Menthol**, Limonene**, Camphor**, Pinene**, Citrus Aurantium Bergamia Peel Oil, Linalool**, Beta-Caryophyllene**, Vanillin, Linalyl Acetate**, Eugenia Caryophyllus Oil, Eugenol**, Citrus Aurantium Peel Oil, Citrus Limon Peel Oil, Pogostemon Cablin Oil, Santalol**, Coumarin, Carvone**.<br>* from organic farming. ** made using organic ingredients.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

